= High school applications (difficult)
3 types of public high schools:
1. Specialized
2. Screened
3. Performing arts (laguardia + frank sinatra)

Each applicant can be admitted to a maximum of one school in each category
However, this is far from a guarantee.
At my middle school, ~30 students were not admitted to any high school.
There is no "default" school.

What does high school look like?
Highly dependent on which school you go to

